From c325ece270140acfcd6d809918e3a0586610f0c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:38:48 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Corvid v1.1: turn on the RTMP/SRT server with a key where a
 source needs it

The wizard and the channel editor turn the server on and give it a random
stream key in one step, and point out a server without a key. The RTMP
address is also shown as OBS's two fields, server and stream key.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
