ost?\",\"7azpIK\":\"What does \\\"Check before broadcast\\\" look at?\",\"lhlbNK\":\"What does Disconnect stop?\",\"VcjQtg\":\"What does the strip under the player show?\",\"LRnuU0\":\"What happens when I save?\",\"PXnlRt\":\"What is the process report for?\",\"A9QLUY\":\"What protects the panel?\",\"R08QdE\":\"What protects the streams?\",\"2cJahA\":\"What saving will do\",\"hJfWkA\":\"Katero prednastavitev hitrosti uporabiti.\",\"Gc+K5X\":\"What the player and the player page use.\",\"1tuX3F\":\"What viewers get when the source is lost: first the backup stream, then the standby image.\",\"y88XJH\":\"When should it start?\",\"v1LoZm\":\"Where are the recordings and how long are they kept?\",\"5mb2Jo\":\"Where do I see the FFmpeg command and the log?\",\"iV4gX/\":\"Where should the backup stream come from?\",\"NGmcNp\":\"Where the picture and sound come from and how they are encoded.\",\"/QQonP\":\"Where the result is written.\",\"6Pz2IF\":\"Kam shraniti seznam predvajanja HLS in segmente. Priporočljivo je v pomnilniku.\",\"UbFVPQ\":\"Which picture goes into the output.\",\"FT9rhf\":\"Which sound goes into the output.\",\"FFqHS7\":\"Which source should I use?\",\"KFzIbt\":\"While the source restarts, viewers see the backup for a few seconds.\",\"aWHAbR\":\"bela\",\"eYL7fx\":[\"Whole log (\",[\"0\"],\" lines)\"],\"c9e3oX\":\"Whom operators should call. Shown under Help > Support.\",\"SeQbZK\":\"Whom to call can be written here: System > General > Support text.\",\"aFWU1n\":\"Širina\",\"9Efoaq\":\"With a key, only senders and players that carry it are accepted. Setting it restarts the server: every stream stops for a few seconds, and every device that sends to this server must get the new address before it can send again. Do this when nothing is on air.\",\"FFEjcY\":\"With a password the file is encrypted and useless without it; there is no way to recover a forgotten password. An encrypted file is imported with its password in the first field. Before an import, the current state is downloaded first, so you can go back.\",\"gmU+g8\":\"With a watch key the main key only sends from the internet; whoever watches from there uses the watch key, which cannot send. The server itself and the private network (10.x, 172.16–31.x, 192.168.x) keep using the main key, so the server's own processes and the local network are not affected.\",\"e0wV2Y\":\"Zaščita pri pisanju\",\"+KXV8X\":\"Writes nothing: the process only measures.\",\"+F4wwU\":\"Writes the programme to files on this server.\",\"r5jQFV\":\"Writes what viewers get as HLS for the player.\",\"l75CjT\":\"Da\",\"WPUsOF\":\"Čarovnika ne morete prekiniti, ker mora biti opredeljen vsaj en vnos.\",\"uvHE7H\":\"You find the key under Status and tools → Keys.\",\"qwY9F9\":\"Spremenili ste konfiguracijo. Da bi spremembe začele veljati, morate znova zagnati aplikacijo. Ali želite zdaj znova zagnati aplikacijo?\",\"nxq2ni\":\"Ponovno povezavo morate vzpostaviti ročno.\",\"RM3CEc\":\"Spremembe niso shranjene. Pred ponovnim nadzorom storitve jih shranite.\",\"/cg7qS\":\"Vaš tok je treba kodirati, vendar ni na voljo ustreznega kodirnika.\",\"BwrOm6\":\"Vaš tok je treba kodirati. Izberite želeni kodirnik:\",\"eqPmeO\":\"Preskusni vzorec YUV\"}")};
